{"author":[{"collection_id":"Authors","document_content":{"avatar":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_50ac3cbb26fa4c21a9967e26675f94c5_/369c95fe5019b07e689d250a71b99f23e954b4b1e7288cc521f9534e2f1b26e3402000d0d9b0ec2b449c286617c23522d81fa4a5aad5de6e88a30a6f158b944d","height":212,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/WXzPP98RdDrDneOh7QCxSdNkjwk9_ACKefFU5vhW7DtED5EeHavMyWl7ttNSOzpRiLZqvYoZCQxVwxJ7Bi47CN8h4tj_nqxjuTsH1szGG5nt1dZgwtr1","width":212},"name":"Susanna Zaraysky","title":"Content Strategist, Fonts"},"document_id":6292121203769344,"document_label":null,"repo_id":"mio-example"}],"body_content":[{"code_snippet":[],"content":"<p>如果你是互联网早期的 Web 设计师，可能还记得当时“Web 安全”字体寥寥无几，例如 Arial 和 Georgia。因此，许多网站看起来都大同小异。想要使用一款新字体，就得为布局中的每个标题嵌入小小的 Flash 文件。</p>\n<p>如今，随着 <a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/glossary/web_font\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Web 字体</a>和<a href=\"https://fonts.google.com/knowledge/using_variable_fonts_on_the_web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">可变字体</a>的出现，情况已发生巨大变化。设计师有了多得多的字体选择，可以定制自己的网站与品牌。</p>\n<p>以下是可变字体正在改变字体排印的一些方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它们让设计师能够借助不同的字重、字宽和其他轴（axis），创造出更加细腻、更富表现力的字体排印。</li>\n<li>它们能减少需要加载的字体文件数量，从而提升网页性能。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Tobias Kunisch 从 2010 年 Google 的一名网站管理员，成长为 Google Fonts 的联合创始人之一，Google Fonts 的使命是免费提供开源字体。Kunisch 在 2023 年 6 月于旧金山举行的 <a href=\"https://config.figma.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Figma Config 大会</a>上，讲述了字体如何如同软件一般，以及它们如何开启数字设计的新可能。</p>\n<p>在 YouTube 上观看他的演讲：</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; max-width: 100%; height: 0;\"><iframe style=\"border-radius: 16px; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/-27L7iqFocI?si=oWcbwfiRx1UJOkeu\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/materialdesign?sub_confirmation=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">订阅 Material Design</a>，获取更多设计相关视频。</p>","image":[],"related_links":[],"table":[],"video":[]}],"category":"2023","hero":{"a11y_description":"Splitscreen: tobias and a screenshot of text in an app","bordered":true,"caption":null,"case":null,"file":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/2e728362671229af2c7a87691fc94ff422b1a4859b2d82fd64999947af99f673d036d7736041979c46d23130d3fcae789388639a662cc99d7eeb33d4e8b59a04","height":1384,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/UZDpLpdaA00MuMc0cBiRzQTG3zvUR-ZMHyI7LALYCBzw3ZA7hRxnb-bwy4GZS7yqJhAxbIBWtQMQiAO4saj2W2YgfA-LAyFU26Zu3ilF_4l_SB3YOTk","width":2461}},"hero_card":false,"metadata":{"keywords":"fonts video how-to","meta_robots":" ","schema_structure":"{}","share_description":"回顾 Google Fonts 在 Figma Config 2023 上的演讲","share_image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_f3e8a4f639ce4c5aafa231fcb8daa630_/35fa0a72d7e29936b768974ad1be33031fb13a51d65f6eece8a68dce9b2eb29672c9c17d1a54d22c31b30df50b5c25713a4ac534cc60856431e32066813c6d01","height":1384,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/cYWxgKkl5jYw0JO4OcSphMsQnGslv1uF2079rHpqeGENxk3bJP1F1BR9ElV8FbaMlPxmedn0Ij0Kqi4zd5YEStoBXjYquDVYRR-wN16ZbcQ71mHMWQ","width":2461},"share_title":"Video: Fonts are software"},"published_date":"2023-08-24T13:00:00","slug":"fonts-are-software-video","subtitle":"回顾 Google Fonts 在 Figma Config 2023 上的演讲","title":"视频：字体即软件","up_next":{"items":[{"collection_id":"UpNextItems","document_content":{"image":{"file_path":"_f68a99ffe9144467a917320028f1ce3b_/_67af19389b5f45048ff0f3b64759ab41_/0fdd6e585c167efbb12841bc6d4196ffca44662c6928e583881041686d5ddedc14f8ae7ee78f05986c156c069a3e8b466c4909eee1c0a58ddd521629bb9dc38c","height":532,"url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/t53yjKYzXLUMbZdsIWnTsrbhcSXAvj8xuldbHZwR1Z1H6nv8b3qjPmzlw57P7MvenJIOQO7Z_ICNiLqog2O4yrlvpsi4c-GLh7SFLfj7uljAN3AkU44","width":1064},"link":{"aria_label":null,"href":"/blog/google-fonts-pairing-figma","label":"You Asked for it—Here Are Some of Our Favorite Font Pairings","open_new_window":false},"sect